+the writer wait skipped; only with the split's back running). Before it parks, the front publishes
+what it sent and asks the back for its idle hook (the deferred copy submission), noted as a
+waiter's request for EDEN_UP_SUBMIT_STATS. With EDEN_UP_LISTWAIT_STATS=1 also: parks, resumed
+entries that parked again, and the parked time (DmaPusher::list_park_start, new in dma_pusher.h).
+EDEN_NX2_LIST_ASYNC itself is untouched (read and used as before).
