+
+Unset: ListPark() is a cached false, the call site passes the pending pointer exactly when
+EDEN_NX2_LIST_ASYNC is set, as T185, and no other line runs: as T185 (and as 1090). Same files as
+1090 plus dma_pusher.h, none a translation id input; EDEN_UP_LIST_PARK is not in
